// Static, tree-shakeable icon registry. Named imports (instead of the
// previous `import * as icons from 'lucide-react'`) let Rollup drop every
// icon component this app doesn't actually use — the wildcard import was
// pulling the entire ~2000-icon library into the main bundle since
// `icons[dynamicKey]` access defeats tree-shaking entirely.
//
// This list is generated by cross-referencing every `name="..."` /
// `icon="..."` / `icon: '...'` literal in src/ against lucide-react's
// real export names — see the icon-audit process in CLAUDE.md if you add
// a new icon name and it silently fails to render (Icon logs a console
// warning in that case, so check the console first).

